      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "author": "Samira Linton <samira.linton@cyberworld.edu>",
      "subject": "BikeForge Approved Name Servers",
      "shortSummary": "Approved DNS baseline and the command for checking published name servers.",
      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "Hi {player},\r\n\r\nBikeForge confirms that its approved authoritative name servers are:\r\n- <b>ns1.bikeforge.host</b>\r\n- <b>ns2.bikeforge.host</b>\r\n\r\nRun <b>dig NS BikeForgeGames.com</b> and compare the <b>ANSWER SECTION</b> with this list. Preserve the complete response, including the resolver and query time, before recommending any change.\r\n\r\nAn unexpected record requires verification; it does not by itself prove compromise or malicious intent.\r\n\r\nSamira",
      "attachements": []
    }
  ]
}
